WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.807
Match setup: the match info, both teams, then the coin toss.

2
00:00:02.857 --> 00:00:05.477
Official match: "Load match from schedule" fills it in.

3
00:00:05.527 --> 00:00:12.527
"Edit": date, hall, referees, scorer, line judges and the match format.

4
00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:17.123
"Edit roster": players, liberos, captain and bench officials.

5
00:00:17.173 --> 00:00:24.173
A new player: number, name, licence number (or date of birth), then "Add".

6
00:00:26.876 --> 00:00:30.346
The libero column marks L1 and L2, "C" marks the captain.

7
00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.383
"Roster import": one switch, "Remote", "PDF" or "Photo". Only the chosen way shows.

8
00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:37.633
"PDF": The team's roster PDF or the Einsatzliste, from this device.

9
00:00:37.683 --> 00:00:42.691
"Photo": first the "Language of the list", then "Take a photo" or "Choose a picture".

10
00:00:42.741 --> 00:00:47.044
The players go straight into the roster; the fields to check are marked.

11
00:00:47.094 --> 00:00:51.603
Coaches can send their own roster: "Remote" shows the Upload PIN.

12
00:00:51.653 --> 00:00:54.979
Below the players: the bench officials.

13
00:00:55.029 --> 00:00:57.327
"Confirm" saves the roster.

14
00:00:57.377 --> 00:01:02.259
Tap a shirt to change the team colour.

15
00:01:02.309 --> 00:01:06.507
All set: "Coin toss".
